Package: VEHouseholdVehiclesIncCap
Type: Package
Title: Model household vehicles with driver and vehicle adjustments. Income caps applied on vehicle ownership model, so that decline in vehicles doesn't happen at highest income.
Version: 2.1.0
Date: 2023-11-03
Author: Brian Gregor [aut, cre], Aditya Gore <aditya.gore@rsginc.com> [cre]
Maintainer: Brian Gregor <gregorb@or-analytics.com>, Aditya Gore <aditya.gore@rsginc.com>
Copyright: AASHTO
Description: This package contains modules which predict number of drivers in a households.
 The module is different than the one in VEHouseholdVehicles package as the income data
 is capped before feeding into driver model.
License: file LICENSE
LazyData: TRUE
LazyDataCompression: bzip2
